.TH PEUBUD 1 "2026-05-14" "0.1.0" "PeuBud User Manual"
.SH NAME
peubud \- personal budget manager with encrypted database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B peubud
[\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B PeuBud
is a personal budget application in C++20/Qt6 with focus on Brazilian
fiscal rules. It tracks income, expenses, investments and credit card
installments. The database is encrypted with XChaCha20-Poly1305 + Argon2id
key derivation; private files use the \fI.pbd\fR extension.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I FILE
Optional path to a \fI.pbd\fR database file to open on startup.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/Documents/PeuBud/
Default save folder.
.TP
.I ~/Backups/peubud/
Default backup destination.
.TP
.I ~/.config/petrinhu/PeuBud.conf
QSettings preferences (language, currency, market provider, etc).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B QT_LOGGING_RULES
Standard Qt logging filter (e.g. \fI*.debug=true\fR).
.SH BUGS
Report at https://github.com/petrinhu/orcamento-pessoal/issues
